  DesignerSolution: "Luy\u1EC7n: ch\u1ECDn nh\xE1nh d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn h\xECnh h\u1ECDc;
    nh\u1EADn bi\u1EBFt v\xE0 t\u1EF1 quay l\u1EA1i khi ch\u1ECDn sai. B\u1ED1 tr\xED:
    P12 \u2014 kho\u1EA3ng t\xE1m kh\xFAc \u0111\u1ED5i h\u01B0\u1EDBng v\xE0 m\u1ED9t
    nh\xE1nh ph\u1EE5 ng\u1EAFn, nh\xECn r\xF5 \u0111i\u1EC3m k\u1EBFt th\xFAc.\nRecovery:
    Nh\xE1nh ph\u1EE5 c\xF3 ch\u1ED7 xoay v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng r\xFAt ng\u1EAFn;
    kh\xF4ng gi\u1EA5u \u0111\u1EA7u c\u1EE5t sau nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EDBp k\xEDnh"
